    "rich_text_LeJhVW": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_DEGkiV": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "More About our Cafe & Business Model",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_m8PUcF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p></p><p>Kicking off in 2016 as a roasting and wholesale business, we opened our flagship cafe and roastery in 2019 in South Seattle, just south of Columbia City (have you heard of Hillman City?).</p><p>The physical space was intentionally built to serve as a community hub, highlight the stories of coffee growers, and bring people together in a diverse, culturally rich neighborhood.</p><p>The grand opening included a community mural project involving local artists and students, reinforcing the cafe’s neighborhood-first identity.</p><p>Our approach to specialty coffee is based on a “farmer-first” model, which goes beyond traditional fair trade to pay growers more than standard market rates, share ongoing revenue from coffee sales (not just one-time payments), and emphasize transparency.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
